meta {
  name: Create IOCL fuel card for a truck (VAHN_ADMIN)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/fuel-cards/create-card
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{plutusApiAdminPanIoclAdminToken}}
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "truckId": {{plutusApiAdminPanIoclTruckId}},
    "provider": "IOCL",
    "mobileNumber": "{{plutusApiAdminPanIoclCardMobile}}"
  }
}

assert {
  res.body.statusCode: eq 200
}

docs {
  `FuelCardResource.createFuelCard` (VAHN_ADMIN only) -> `FuelCardService.createFuelCardForTruckV2`.
  Run once per truck. It skips IOCL if the truck already has an ACTIVE IOCL card (a FAILED card does not
  block a retry), reuses the IOCL customer of the truck's PAN or creates one from the PAN and the
  torg's Aadhaar, then creates the card. `plutusApiAdminPanIoclCardMobile` is optional; empty uses the
  driver's phone.
  statusCode 400 "Active fuel card already exists for all attempted providers": the queued creation
  from step 2 already made it. A retry won't help for "PAN already exists for this Partner" (orphaned
  customer after a timeout) or "PAN Number already exists against an IOCL-onboarded customer".
}
